UID:rqqdVOF3cC
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 75 mins (1h15m)\n\nRomanian Film Festival Seattle In
 spired by the 1941 Fântâna Albă tragedy\, the film recreates the strugg
 les faced by a Romanian community in Bessarabia while under Soviet occupat
 ion during WWII. A young couple gets separated when the wife and daughters
  are deported to Siberia\, leaving the husband guilt-ridden in Romania. Q&
 A with director Tudor Giurgiu.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/
 romanian-film-festival-seattle/the-spruce-forest\n\nEstimated start: 12:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
