SUMMARY:High School Thieves
DTSTART:20251108T221000Z
DTEND:20251109T001500Z
DTSTAMP:20251108T221000Z
UID:ytdON3Bstc
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 110 mins (1h50m)\n\nRomanian Film Festival Seattle F
 our teenagers sell the SAT prompts online to fund their dreams: college\, 
 a recording studio\, dad’s approval and adventure. Everything is going w
 ell until they are all forced to face the reality around them and the cons
 equences of their actions.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/roma
 nian-film-festival-seattle/high-school-thieves\n\nEstimated start: 14:25
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Ink Wash
DTSTART:20251109T002500Z
DTEND:20251109T021000Z
DTSTAMP:20251109T002500Z
UID:VrCa0hcSBp
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 90 mins (1h30m)\n\nRomanian Film Festival Seattle Se
 eking shelter in her work from the pain of a breakup\, Lena\, a painter tu
 rning 40\, is commissioned to decorate a brutalist hotel nestled in the de
 pths of a Romanian forest. Lena’s moral views are confronted with an ove
 rwhelmingly corrupted community.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theater
 s/romanian-film-festival-seattle/ink-wash\n\nEstimated start: 16:40
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Dream
DTSTART:20251109T022000Z
DTEND:20251109T045500Z
DTSTAMP:20251109T022000Z
UID:c8RIMYCdRT
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 136 mins (2h16m)\n\nRomanian Film Festival Seattle A
 lex\, a downcast actor facing both romantic and professional failure\, sta
 rts an unusual creative project: staging a play inside a prison. What begi
 ns as an artistic experiment evolves into a transformative experience for 
 the inmates.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/romanian-film-fest
 ival-seattle/the-dream\n\nEstimated start: 18:35
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:TWST: Things We Said Today
DTSTART:20251109T192500Z
DTEND:20251109T210500Z
DTSTAMP:20251109T192500Z
UID:irL7SdtqhS
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 85 mins (1h25m)\n\nRomanian Film Festival Seattle TW
 ST takes as its starting point the arrival of the Beatles in New York for 
 their August 1965 concert at Shea Stadium. But the frame of reference stea
 dily broadens and adjacent realities of 1965 are juxtaposed—the New York
  World’s Fair and the Watts riots in Los Angeles.\n\nhttps://www.siff.ne
 t/cinema/in-theaters/romanian-film-festival-seattle/twst-things-we-said-to
 day\n\nEstimated start: 11:40
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
