DTEND:20251110T013000Z
DTSTAMP:20251109T233000Z
UID:pulbZdA0Qq
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 104 mins (1h44m)\n\nRomanian Film Festival Seattle A
  diverse and hilarious cast of characters in contemporary Moldova encounte
 rs surprising opportunities and obstacles through a series of unexpected a
 dventures\, all capturing the essence of humor\, struggles\, and spirit of
  both rural and urban life. Q&A with director Natalia Shaufert.\n\nhttps:/
 /www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/romanian-film-festival-seattle/moldovan-t
 ales\n\nEstimated start: 15:45
