DTSTART:20251110T020000Z
DTEND:20251110T034500Z
DTSTAMP:20251110T020000Z
UID:wepU8UEO2x
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 88 mins (1h28m)\n\nThis is the story of Seita and hi
 s younger sister Setsuko\, two children born at the wrong time\, in the wr
 ong place\, and now cast adrift in a world that lacks not the care to shel
 ter them\, but simply the resources.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-the
 aters/grave-of-the-fireflies\n\nEstimated start: 18:15
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
