SUMMARY:The New Year That Never Came
DTSTART:20251110T020000Z
DTEND:20251110T043500Z
DTSTAMP:20251110T020000Z
UID:23vjiXD6Xd
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 138 mins (2h18m)\n\nRomanian Film Festival Seattle I
 n December of 1989 Ceaușescu’s regime is on its last legs and any news 
 that reaches Bucharest is scant and sanitised. Six people find themselves 
 in the eye of the storm without realizing it. Q&A with cinematographer Bor
 oka Biro.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/romanian-film-festiva
 l-seattle/the-new-year-that-never-came\n\nEstimated start: 18:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
