DESCRIPTION:Duration: 123 mins (2h03m)\n\nCinema Italian Style A gripping 
 historical drama inspired by the incredible true story of Margot Wölk\, a
  woman who was conscripted to be one of Hitler’s food tasters.Opening Ni
 ght Film + Party Tickets: $25\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/
 cinema-italian-style-2025/the-tasters\n\nEstimated start: 18:45
